# The model the app loads. A fresh clone plays without training.
!checkpoints/ddsp_009.pt
!checkpoints/ddsp_009.json
# Warm-start ancestors for --adapt only. None of these can be loaded by the
# current model: ddsp_004 predates the level factoring, and ddsp_006/007 are
# the direct-amplitude and envelope pair from before the aperiodicity input.
# They are 2.5 MB each and are what makes `--adapt` reproducible from scratch.
!checkpoints/ddsp_004.pt
!checkpoints/ddsp_004.json
!checkpoints/ddsp_006.pt
!checkpoints/ddsp_006.json
!checkpoints/ddsp_007.pt
!checkpoints/ddsp_007.json

